      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "はははっ！\r\nあの気持ち悪い科学者、いい度胸してるじゃねえか。\r\n俺たちを裏切るなんて。",
        "official_en": "Ha ha ha! That sick scientist sure got guts. To think he’d betray us like that...",
        "real_en": "Hahaha! That creepy scientist has some nerve, betraying us like that."
      },
      "review": {
