      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ラザロフの奴め。\r\nインビンシブルを持ち出したまま戻らないとは……。",
        "official_en": "That Lazarov... I never imagined he would make off with the <text style=\"italic\">Invincible</>.",
        "real_en": "That Lazarov... He took the <text style=\"italic\">Invincible</> and still hasn't returned..."
