      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "俺に気を遣う必要などない。\r\n六盟傑の宿願を邪魔する者は\r\nお前の業火で焼き尽くすがいい。",
        "official_en": "There is no need for that. Let all who interfere with the Sworn Six be burnt to ash in your hellfire.",
        "real_en": "You don't need to worry about me. Burn anyone who stands in the way of the Sworn Six's long-held ambition to ash with your inferno."
      },
      "review": {
