      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "天風と水華を退けたんだ。\r\n強い奴に決まってる。\r\nお前もあいつと戦いたいんだろ？",
        "official_en": "He put the punishment on both Aether and Alluvion. He must be quite a tough ’un. I’ll bet you’d like to have a crack at him first, wouldn’t you?",
        "real_en": "He drove back Heavenly Wind Veritas and Water Bloom Veritas. He must be strong. You want to fight him too, don't you?"
